Package: asahi-scripts
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3, device-tree-compiler, gzip, util-linux, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: aurora-stage2-ctxr-slot (= 1), aurora-stage2-trial (= 1)
Description: Apple Silicon maintenance scripts with Aurora's Stage 2 updater
 asahi-alarm's maintenance scripts and dracut modules (vendor firmware in the
 initrd), with Aurora's update-m1n1: a kernel, aura or U-Boot update composes a
 new Stage 2, arms aura's one-shot trial and keeps the live image until
 aurora-stage2-commit.service accepts the trial boot. A guard timer returns an
 uncommitted trial to the configured Stage 2.
